\section{Reflection}{
\p{\strong{What went well today?} I had very good focus throughout the first two blocks today. I pretty deeply understand the [[F3T0]] and have pretty much made the connection with [[foxMultiLevelDiscoveryDeep2017]]. Overall, I still do not feel like I made a ton of tangible progress. I think I just have to bet on consistency over spurts of substantial production. Three hours of focus like today stacked over a long period of time will inevitably lead to results. I just need to ensure I am allocating my focus towards the right things.}
\p{\strong{What went bad today?} I have not been able to get myself to do any exploratory reading prior to dinner. I did not expect this to be a high \em{limbic friction} habit, but it turns out I may need to re-order to earlier when I have more energy. I still am caught up with my existing Anki cards and this habit has become somewhat solidified. I once again crashed post-lunch, but it may just be the result of circadian rhythm and something I need to plan around. I do not know what useful, low-cognitive-overhead tasks I can allocated to the block between running and lunch.}
}
